      "message": "Remove redundant per-repo lockfile + lockfile workflows\n\nThe tofu-plan-apply-template already curls both shared-providers.tf\nand .terraform.lock.hcl from infra-bootstrap/main/tofu/provider/ at\ninit time, so the committed lockfile and the lockfile-check/update\nworkflows are dead weight. Single source of truth is now\ninfra-bootstrap/tofu/provider/.terraform.lock.hcl.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
